{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"HttpWalletProvider"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The installation registers once, at its first Wallet Attestation:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"over a "},{"code":"registration","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" challenge, it makes a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"registration key"}]},{"type":"text","text":" in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key store of its own ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/registrationKeyStore()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") and an App Attest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key, has Apple attest the App Attest key over the client data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"naming the registration key, registers both ("},{"code":"POST \/v1\/instances","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and keeps the instance ID and the two keys’ IDs in its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InstanceRegistry","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":". The registration key signs every later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet-Provider-Request"},{"type":"text","text":"); no attestation names it. If"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the registration, its key or the App Attest key is lost, the next"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Wallet Attestation registers again, with new keys. An App Attest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key a registration made but couldn’t register — App Attest’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"server or the provider unavailable, or no connection — is kept, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this process, and tried again by the next registration, as Apple"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asks; it’s dropped when the provider or App Attest refuses it."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/walletAttestation(clientID:instanceKey:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" asks for a Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Attestation for the instance key ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"instance_key"},{"type":"text","text":"). The first time,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it sends an App Attest assertion over a fresh "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"instance"},{"type":"text","text":" challenge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the key, which the provider records the key with; once it has,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the key alone — and the assertion again if the provider no longer"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"has its record ("},{"code":"evidence_required","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/keyAttestation(instanceKey:keys:nonce:)"},{"type":"text","text":" asks for a Key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Attestation over the holder keys, with one assertion over a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"holder"},{"type":"text","text":" challenge and all of them, for the issuance of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance key, which a Wallet Attestation recorded."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"App Attest attests the app, not the wallet’s keys: the provider"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"learns that a genuine copy of the app on a genuine Apple device asked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for them, not where they are. Make them in the Secure Enclave all the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same ("},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"‘s default). Where App Attest isn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"supported — the Simulator, some older devices — the wallet can’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"register, and every attestation fails as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".platform"},{"type":"text","text":": there’s no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unattested path, in development either. A development build (the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.apple.developer.devicecheck.appattest-environment"},{"type":"text","text":" entitlement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"set to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"development"},{"text":") makes development-environment keys, which only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a provider configured for them accepts.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Assertions are made one at a time, each sent before the next is made,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as the provider accepts only an assertion whose counter exceeds the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"last it took, and the installation registers once. Every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HttpWalletProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" over the same "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileInstanceRegistry"},{"text":" file (or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryInstanceRegistry"},{"text":") in the process shares that","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order, so a wallet rebuilt mid-issuance with a new provider is still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"serialised with the old one. Over a registry of its own type, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provider serialises only its own calls: keep one provider for it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It sends nothing but to its base URL, over https, following no"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"redirect, with its timeout for each request, and reads at most","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"256 KiB of an answer. It checks a Wallet Attestation is for the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"client and the instance key, and a Key Attestation is over the nonce","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"sent and attests only keys sent; their signatures are the issuer’s to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"verify.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Failures reach the wallet as ","type":"text"},{"code":"WalletError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"s: one the network or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provider’s availability caused (no connection, a timeout, HTTP 5xx or"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"429, a challenge that expired before it was used, App Attest’s server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unavailable) as "},{"code":".network","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which may be retried"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProviderUnavailableError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"); a refusal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProviderRefusedError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":") as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".platform"},{"type":"text","text":", its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"protocolError"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the protocol’s error code (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"instance_not_active"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"instance_revoked"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"invalid_signed_request","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", …), which "},{"code":"localizedDescription","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" explains to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder. On "},{"code":"instance_revoked","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", it forgets the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"registration and deletes its registration key: the next Wallet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Attestation registers the installation again. The revoked instance’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance keys stay its own (","type":"text"},{"code":"instance_key_registered","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credential whose refresh needs one must be received again. On","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"instance_not_active","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (suspended) it keeps the registration: tell the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder, as the provider may resume it. A signed request refused as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"invalid_signed_request","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" isn’t retried: check the device’s clock, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that the provider still knows the instance.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/IntegrationChecklist","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InstanceRegistry","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileInstanceRegistry","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryInstanceRegistry","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/RegisteredInstance","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/AppAttestService","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeviceAppAttestService","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/AppAttestKeyLostError","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProviderRefusedError"],"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials","generated":true}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" over the Wallet Provider HTTP protocol, version"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"1, that OID4VCgo’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"walletprovider.Provider.Handler"},{"text":" serves","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo\/blob\/main\/mobile\/WALLET_PROVIDER.md","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"),","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"with Apple App Attest (","type":"text"},{"code":"apple-app-attest","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") as its evidence:","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/init(baseURL:instances:registrationKeys:appAttest:timeout:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/keyAttestation(instanceKey:keys:nonce:)","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/sweepOrphanedRegistrationKeys()","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HttpWalletProvider\/walletAttestation(clientID:instanceKey:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID